28)----------------------------TableScan: date_dim projection=[d_date_sk, d_year, d_moy], partial_filters=[date_dim.d_moy >= Int64(4), date_dim.d_moy <= Int64(10), date_dim.d_year = Int64(2001)]
29)------------------SubqueryAlias: d3
