07)------------RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=1
08)--------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(ss_item_sk@0, i_item_sk@0)], projection=[ss_net_profit@1, sr_net_loss@2, cs_net_profit@3, s_store_id@4, s_store_name@5, i_item_id@7, i_item_desc@8]
